{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Gaze Awareness.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Gaze Awareness.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"gaze awareness gaze awareness","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Gaze Awareness.md","fileName":"Gaze Awareness.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Gaze Awareness","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 21:16\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Collaborative Augmented Reality]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Collaborative Augmented Reality","augmentedreality_pearson.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Gaze Awareness.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Gaze Awareness.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"gaze awareness gaze awareness","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Gaze Awareness.md","fileName":"Gaze Awareness.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Gaze Awareness","heading":"Gaze Awareness","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Gaze awareness is the ability of collaborators to understand where another participant is looking or directing attention. In person this is partly conveyed by head and eye orientation; mediated AR may need to preserve or explicitly visualize the cue.\n\nKnowing a partner's focus helps resolve references such as “this part” and coordinates turn-taking around shared objects. Approximate gaze can be useful, but the interface should not imply more measurement precision than the tracker provides.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Collaborative Augmented Reality","augmentedreality_pearson.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Gaze Awareness.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Gaze Awareness.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"gaze awareness gaze awareness","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Gaze Awareness.md","fileName":"Gaze Awareness.md","fo